  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Hatched in the Cryo-Labs abandoned long ago. The exposure did something... different to him. Now he haunts the Hideout Billit, searching for a cure to the Zombie rot or someone dumb enough try and steal his stash of DRIP.",
